@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080
@key = user:demo

### Health check
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### Prometheus metrics
GET {{baseUrl}}/metrics

### Check rate limit (cost 1)
POST {{baseUrl}}/v1/check
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "key": "{{key}}",
  "cost": 1
}

### Check rate limit (cost 5)
POST {{baseUrl}}/v1/check
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "key": "{{key}}",
  "cost": 5
}

### Check rate limit (default cost)
POST {{baseUrl}}/v1/check
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "key": "{{key}}"
}

### Check rate limit (other key)
POST {{baseUrl}}/v1/check
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "key": "user:other",
  "cost": 1
}

### Hello protected route
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/hello